# Verso — device-type icons by hostname keyword.
#
# The companion to mac-oui-icons, and the primary signal for devices whose MAC
# is randomized (modern phones/laptops), where the OUI identifies nothing but
# the DHCP hostname still names the device ("Toms-iPhone", "living-room-sonos").
#
# Format:  <keyword> <icon>
# The device's hostname is lowercased; the FIRST keyword found as a substring
# wins, so list the more specific keywords first. <icon> must be a name defined
# in internal/widget/icons.go. Blank lines and '#' comments are ignored.
#
# Keep keywords distinctive to avoid false matches on arbitrary names.

# Apple
iphone      phone
ipad        tablet
macbook     laptop
imac        device
apple-tv    tv
appletv     tv
apple-watch watch

